{% doc %}
Ensures the V3 Refine Products navy title bar reaches both rounded top corners while the filter body stays white throughout scrolling, preserving the sticky desktop sidebar. Armed Forces Gear is hard-locked to Shop by Branch, Availability, and Shop by Type in that order.
{% enddoc %}
